  "highlights": [
    "Red beat Blue 38.5 to 31 in the Red vs. Blue team competition.",
    "Red took the pre-week points: HQ Attendance, the AI Survey and 6 Subjective Points to Blue's 4. Blue won Black Midnight.",
    "In the tournaments, Red won Settlers of Catan, Speed Chess and Pool; Blue won Beyblades in the new Terrordome, Super Smash Bros and the inaugural Bouncy Ping Pong.",
    "Tuesday's Matrix-themed Team Night Events: Red won This is Zion, Electric City Matrix, Deja Vu and Guns, Lots of Guns; Blue won Red Pill / Blue Pill, There is No Spoon and The Keymaker.",
    "Thursday was Rise of the Machines AI Day, closing with an AI Round Table.",
    "The Centurion and Four Score Clubs stayed retired, keeping War Week hours about quality over quantity."
